# The generated Xcode project. scaffold.sh rebuilds it from the pinned
# toolchain in packaging/ios/package.json, and it carries a copy of dist/
# inside it - so it is build output, not source. Anything the owner must set
# BY HAND in Xcode (signing, the bridging-header build setting, the IAP
# capability) is written down in packaging/ios/README.md instead, because a
# generated project cannot be trusted to preserve it.
packaging/ios/ios/
